### Health check
GET http://localhost:5080/health

### Customer lookup (found)
GET http://localhost:5080/api/customers/CUST-1001

### Customer lookup (not found -> structured 404 error)
GET http://localhost:5080/api/customers/CUST-9999

### Payment validation (valid -> APPROVED)
POST http://localhost:5080/api/payments/validate
Content-Type: application/json
X-Correlation-Id: demo-0001

{
  "currency": "GBP",
  "amount": 250.00,
  "debtorAccount": "GB00TEST00000000000001",
  "creditorAccount": "GB00TEST00000000000002"
}

### Payment validation (over threshold -> REVIEW_REQUIRED)
POST http://localhost:5080/api/payments/validate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "currency": "GBP",
  "amount": 25000.00,
  "debtorAccount": "GB00TEST00000000000001",
  "creditorAccount": "GB00TEST00000000000002"
}

### Payment validation (invalid -> structured 400 error)
POST http://localhost:5080/api/payments/validate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "currency": "POUND",
  "amount": -5,
  "debtorAccount": "",
  "creditorAccount": ""
}

### Status callback (accepted)
POST http://localhost:5080/api/callbacks/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reference": "CASE-2026-000123",
  "status": "COMPLETED",
  "detail": "Downstream processing finished."
}
